  about: A single-player tablet game designed for naval tactical training. The game
    simulates realistic scenarios to develop situational awareness, decision making,
    command and control skills, and resource management.
  role: I led the game design and development, including mission design, gameplay
    systems, UI/UX, and implementation in Unity. I also collaborated on content,
    testing, and deployment for the pilot programme.
